The vocabulary is converted from the published byte-level vocabulary into
base64 token bytes followed by their unchanged rank. All 199,744 merge
ranks match their vocabulary rank minus 256. Metadata preserves the
published splitting expression and added tokens. Text normalization is NFC.

The upstream license is included verbatim in LICENSE. Commercial use has
attribution and notice requirements; distribution needs those addressed.

